{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274306490986922009", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274306490986922009", "content": "https://store.hikarifield.co.jp/bundles/5\n\n《苍之彼方的四重奏》\n《苍之彼方的四重奏 EXTRA1》\n《苍之彼方的四重奏 EXTRA2》\n《恋爱与选举与巧克力》\n\n上述作品现正以套装形式在HIKARI FIELD STORE以超值价格特卖中！\n购买游戏套装不仅可享单品之间的联动折扣，还可根据购买数量获得额外金额减免。套装机制支持补全购买，即便已拥有部分内容仍可购买。\n\n例如：购买包含 5 款游戏的套装，若一次性购买全部 5 款，则除套装内自带折扣外，还可额外减免 5 元。购买数量越多，减免金额越高。\n\n#HIKARIFIELD# #GALGAME# #GAL# #游戏# #STEAM游戏# #STEAM#  #视觉小说类游戏# #视觉小说#", "publisher": "HIKARI-FIELD", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274306490986922009", "published_at": "2026-11-24T16:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T15:47:51.411683+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2e0c379f920298f49d0745629b9aeb0a41883712.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_41883712", "uid": "41883712", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 224, "retweets": 0, "replies": 12}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
