{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274445647915778050", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274445647915778050", "content": "《雪境迷途遇仙踪》国际中文版现正于Steam促销热卖中！仅需24元即可入手！\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1854980\n\n本作是由日本知名美少女游戏品牌Lump of Sugar（方糖社）于2021年发售的奇幻恋爱作品。国际中文版同时收录了简体中文版与繁体中文版内容，并支持在游戏中进行切换。内置集换卡牌及云存储等功能，并支持额外内容。\n\n《雪境迷途遇仙踪》由知名画师萌木原文武（代表作《游魂》系列）担当游戏原画与角色设计， 由水瀬拓未（代表作《回家之前的棉花糖》）、御厨美粟（代表作《花之天使的夏日恋歌》）、芹（代表作《Happiness! 2 樱花盛典》）、七央结日（代表作《LOVESICK PUPPIES》）和中岛大河（代表作《生命的备份》）多位业内资深写手共同创作剧本， 由知名音乐人新井健史担当音乐制作，主题歌由方糖社当家歌姬Kicco与新锐创作型歌手逢濑晶联袂献唱。\n\n#HIKARIFIELD# #GALGAME# #GAL# #游戏# #STEAM游戏# #STEAM#  #视觉小说类游戏# #视觉小说#", "publisher": "HIKARI-FIELD", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274445647915778050", "published_at": "2026-11-25T01:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T15:47:51.411683+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/18ae8a8d04efb287b0c954f32de5b05341883712.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_41883712", "uid": "41883712", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 195, "retweets": 0, "replies": 2}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274447359441371136", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274447359441371136", "content": "端音乱希/No Future《特工·圣盾桃粉》定档1月21日！\n✨加入愿望单！不错过首发折扣与发售通知！✨\n🔗Steam商店：https://store.steampowered.com/app/4517280?utm_source=bili&utm_campaign=DateAnnounce\n\n✨本作亮点\n・知名同人社团端音乱希/NoFuture人气代表作！\n・战斗少女 ×近未来世界，独自一人对抗邪恶组织！\n・日式RPG × QTE战斗，带来丰富多彩的战斗体验！\n・支持额外内容！收录大量精美CG！\n\n📖故事简介\n故事发生在近未来。隶属于公安组织特里霍尼斯的圣盾桃粉·相川桃与前辈圣盾苍兰·苍井琴叶一起维护城市治安，对抗邪恶组织小丑团。\n然而，特里霍尼斯所长雁内对小丑团畏首畏尾，苍兰忍无可忍，独自前往小丑团据点，就此失踪。\n一个月后，桃粉不顾雁内的阻拦，开始寻找苍兰……\n\n📌作品信息\n・社团：No Future \n・剧本：端音乱希\n・原画：ぷりんぷ\n・声优：藤村莉央 / 梅原亜衣\n\n🌟 同社团其他作品也将登陆Steam！敬请期待！\n🔗《女英雄・集结 -Heroines' Chord-》：\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/5172800?utm_source=bili&utm_campaign=DateAnnounce", "publisher": "Shiravune白舟_官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274447359441371136", "published_at": "2026-11-25T01:06:39+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T15:47:51.411683+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/ba62ce19b9b24b85bc244f1d392dc3133493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/525c9ad56a000e86d9588675d87b3aff3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/a53e48bc0b769ee6eeaa6aca15054b213493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/9a80e82f4091ffe3085ad49afa89b6f53493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/79162ee0ee922c7828c8f1b01f8e94913493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/85a9cdd2e599e6bf6e015bf2737e882b3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/0f3ca44f00bed5970c1a6329fcb5757a3493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/1a3d116cf791773473c9aadd0ed245983493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/faf6ecaf4e51e4bacfa3c0c63197c9413493105997187935.jpg"}], "me