{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274546813715611648", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274546813715611648", "content": "Gamirror Games确认参展新物集BGM游戏展！两款新游等你玩 🎉\n\n🎮 G45展位：《算鼠英雄》\n一款充满数学巧思的卡牌构筑游戏，通过组合卡牌与骰子，凑出等同于敌人的数值，就能直接将其击败！不断强化牌组、玩转数字组合，用你的数学智慧碾压敌人！\n\n🎮 G46展位：《丰饶女神之骰》\n一款由骰子与卡牌驱动的Roguelike村庄建设游戏。分配骰子、触发卡牌、收集资源，一步步发展村庄。在凛冽暴风雪与重重考验之下，你能带领远征队生存到最后吗？\n\n📍 展会信息\n名称：新物集BGM游戏展·上海站\n时间：12月5日-6日 10:00-19:00\n地点：上海市闵行区丰虹路9号虹桥品汇B栋3楼", "publisher": "GamirrorGames", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274546813715611648", "published_at": "2026-11-25T07:32:35+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T15:47:51.411683+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/7f24d8a69acc4e90ae1a7b12415fec7b298686071.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/e42eb06086f59fa521a767c25570b4da298686071.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c05ab047874e068dd111ee0a1d1249f1298686071.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/17ae643c6f0660286ca13a150a14eabe298686071.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_298686071", "uid": "298686071", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 18, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
